Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A Crisis Suddenly Emerges
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Today’s meteor shower is so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s come and make a wish
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous here. Leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a crisis in the starry sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting for? Let’s go together as Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,look at my frisbee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the space war fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry Mr. Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s continue the class
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.59,0:01:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our universe is full of infinite possibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,in other corners of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There may also be various wonderful worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it like the Season Towns, Qimao Kingdom, and the Miaogou Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Those belong to our world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But outside our universe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other more wonderful worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There are all kinds of strange scenery and strange creatures there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then can we go on adventures to those wonderful worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But these are still controversial
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With our current technology, it is temporarily impossible to reach
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Class ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye Mr. Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can dream without falling asleep. How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a space war
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We also want to paint together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,mushroom mushroom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, we bought a lot of mushrooms today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy must be very happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go home quickly, Daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You are finally back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, look, we bought a lot of mushrooms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s awesome Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You go and put the mushrooms in the kitchen first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll help too
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What you need to help with is packing these things
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, these are my treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Broken toothbrush, rotten clothes, smelly shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These are also treasures?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this toothbrush
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It has adapted perfectly to my tooth shape
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This dress is comfortable and breathable
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These sneakers are very memorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You won’t throw these away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then throw it here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t sorted it out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually secretly hid so many useless inventions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All these inventions are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately there was no explosion
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my latest boomerang bomb invention
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be thrown out and fly back again, and the explosion is very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,is very dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so dangerous. How do you want to deal with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll deal with it right away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think there’s something wrong with Wolffy being in such a hurry with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Won’t you know when he comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,what is that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.45,0:04:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy what is this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my inventions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But Wolnie won’t let me keep it at home
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:05:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So I want to store it with you temporarily
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t look like many
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just take some back each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s really troublesome for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too many
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see what’s there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,this magnet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t this the Powerful Magnet you used to catch goats?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Big & Little Pills
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to have eaten
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop thinking about it Stop thinking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally got a smoke bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,These are Dancing Shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally crossed it and you caught me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And these Spring Shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You wore it to jump into Goats’ Village and catch goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Opposite Hammer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I used to catch you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These are all interesting inventions from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:06:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that? I also have a great new invention, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this durian bomb, watermelon bomb, boomerang bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one is powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s help you save the less dangerous ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go home first
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, you are the best
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you misunderstood
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can pick any one of these inventions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll give you a gift
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pick one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will choose the most powerful one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I choose this one or this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me do this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Good taste
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Super Sticker that I carefully designed when I was in the Invention Camp
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing your body copy other people’s super powers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Copy Sticker?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stick it on like this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shake hands like this and you can copy the other person’s super power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But nothing happened now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s because I don’t have super powers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, I’ll study it again when I have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag your stuff back to my house
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I really trouble you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Little thing, I didn’t expect you to keep all these inventions
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, these inventions are not just the result of my hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And it also carries the memories of so many adventures with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wonder what it would be like if we didn’t become friends
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then maybe I would have eaten goats already
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful thought
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:07:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How could there be a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder the longer we drag it, the lighter it becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to pick up the inventions that fell over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there rifts here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Something bad happened
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Very powerful suction
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the wind is getting stronger and stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are these inventions still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the wind so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any goats? Save the wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to Green Green Grassland?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to stop me? Let me see what you can do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wool and gears merged
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t escape
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my invention?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give you a little star
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes another one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s the situation? Who is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know. Maybe he also made the rifts on the grassland and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Difficult guy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please play with toys
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Toys are integrated
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You pissed me off
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s movement over there
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,that is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,rift
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the other parts back for me
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
